Author: Leandro Pereira <leandro@hardinfo.org>
Date:   Sat Oct 26 08:31:53 2019 -0700

    Do not assume that an empty length means "calculate length of string"

    Add new strbuf APIs specifically for this purpose.  This should
    properly fix issues found by OSS-Fuzz in the configuration file parser
    (and remove branches/strlen() calls where it's not really needed!)

